# The image is built from web/ and server/ only. Everything else in the repository — the
# owner directory spreadsheet (personal data), the raw drawings, reference material, local
# uploads and secrets — stays out of the build context.
*
!web
!server
!deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
server/uploads
web/mockups
**/*.xlsx
**/*.log
